  "description": "Due to an unexpected accident, Choi Yu-Jeong, an ordinary college student, owes some money from the owner of a cafe called \"Delicious Blood.\" Daniel, the owner of the cafe, tells Choi Yu-Jeong to pay off her debts by working part-time at his cafe. Choi Yu-Jeong eventually starts a part-time job, but the handsome boss Daniel, doesn't let her off the hook.\n\nWho is Daniel? And what will happen to Yu-Jeong?\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)",
